## Admonitions (Callouts)

Use Docusaurus admonitions for important information:

```markdown
:::tip [Optional Title]
Helpful hints and best practices
:::

:::info [Optional Title]
Additional context or background information
:::

:::warning [Optional Title]
Important caveats or potential issues
:::

:::danger [Optional Title]
Critical warnings that could cause data loss or security issues
:::

:::note [Optional Title]
Side notes and additional details
:::
```

### When to Use Each
- `tip`: Best practices, shortcuts, recommendations
- `info`: Background context, explanations, "why" information
- `warning`: Potential pitfalls, deprecations, important caveats
- `danger`: Security risks, data loss potential, breaking changes
- `note`: Supplementary information, edge cases

