## Tables

### Standard Table Format
| Column 1 | Column 2 | Column 3 |
|----------|----------|----------|
| Value 1 | Value 2 | Value 3 |

### Table Best Practices
1. Always include header row with separator
2. Keep columns aligned with pipes
3. Use consistent formatting within columns
4. Bold important values: `**value**`
5. Use checkmarks and X for boolean: `✅ Yes` / `❌ No`

