}
```

## Blog Posts

Blog posts have additional frontmatter:

```yaml
---
slug: url-friendly-slug
title: Blog Post Title
authors: [author_id]
tags: [tag1, tag2]
---
```

- First paragraph before `<!-- truncate -->` becomes the excerpt
- Include `<!-- truncate -->` after 2-3 sentences

